course: dictionary
lesson: 9995
title: Teenager: ages 13 to 19
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: A teenager is a person between 13 and 19 years old. Look at the word: the «teen» part tells you the age. Every number that ends in -teen, from thirteen to nineteen, is a teen number.
explain: «My cousin is a teenager, so she is 15, 16 or 17.» The number clues show you what teenager means. Teenage years are the years when someone is a teenager, and they are often a time of growing up fast.
explain: Context helps when you meet teenager in a story. «A teenager in Wales cut a bagel while holding it in her palm.» The sentence gives no exact age, but the word teenager tells you she is between 13 and 19. Check by putting your meaning in the sentence: if it still makes sense, you have understood it.
fact: A teenager is a person between 13 and 19 years old.
fact: Teen numbers end in -teen: thirteen, fourteen, fifteen, sixteen, seventeen, eighteen and nineteen.
fact: That makes 7 different ages that a teenager can be.
fact: «Teenage years» means the years when someone is a teenager.
fact: «Picasso could draw very realistically as a teenager» means he could draw in a very lifelike way when he was between 13 and 19.
exercise: How old is a teenager? | Between 1 and 9 years old | Between 20 and 29 years old | Exactly 10 years old | *Between 13 and 19 years old
exercise: «Frida Kahlo was badly hurt in a bus crash as a teenager.» When was she hurt? | *In her teens, between 13 and 19 | After the bus had gone home | When she was very old, over 60 | When she was a baby
exercise: Which of these ages is a teenage age? | 9 | *16 | 21 | 11
test: Ella says «my brother is a teenager, he is 22». Is she right? | Yes, because he is older than 20 | *No, a teenager is 13 to 19, so 22 is not a teenager | Yes, because older brothers are always teenagers
test: How many different ages count as teenage? | 6 | *7 | 10 | 5
exam: In «A teenager in Arizona picked up a rattlesnake to show his friends», which word tells you how old the person is? | friends | *teenager | Arizona | rattlesnake
